  = Executive Summary

  Independent eye care is entering a defining period.

  Across the optical industry, consolidation, vertical integration, private investment, managed vision care pressure, and changing patient expectations are reshaping the way practices compete. Independent optometrists and optical businesses remain central to patient care, community access, product choice, and clinical autonomy, but the business environment around them is becoming more complex and increasingly influenced by larger organizations.

  Artisan Lab Network was created as a response to that shift.

  ALN is a doctor-aligned ophthalmic laboratory network built to strengthen independent eye care through aligned ownership, advanced laboratory capabilities, strategic vendor partnerships, and a shared commitment to long-term independence.

  #pull-quote([ALN is not simply a laboratory company. It is aligned infrastructure for independent eye care.], attribution: "Core Positioning")

  The network connects high-quality ophthalmic manufacturing with the business, technology, vendor, and ownership alignment independent practices need to compete in a changing market. Through its growing laboratory footprint and doctor-aligned model, ALN gives independent eye care professionals a stronger voice in the supply chain that supports their practices.

  The future of independent eye care will not be secured through isolation. It will be secured through collaboration, alignment, and shared ownership of the systems that matter.

  Artisan Lab Network exists to help build that future.

