  = Conclusion

  Independent eye care does not need to become less independent to become more competitive.

  But it does need stronger alignment.

  Artisan Lab Network was built to provide that alignment.

  Through its doctor-aligned ownership model, laboratory network, vendor ecosystem, and commitment to craftsmanship, ALN gives independent practices and industry partners a different path forward.

  The future of independent eye care will belong to those who build together.

  Artisan Lab Network exists to help lead that work.
